{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：14:00 2026-09-09 HKT</p>\n\n<p>一代武俠女星鄭佩佩離世兩年，女兒原子鏸至今未能放下亡母，不時在社交平台發文悼念。日前有傳媒報道，在美國逝世的鄭佩佩遺愛人間；其家屬證實，已遵循鄭佩佩生前遺願，將其大腦捐贈予美國加州的腦部研究機構，期盼能為罕見退化性疾病的病理研究貢獻一份心力。</p>\n<h2>鄭佩佩抗病遺願無私</h2>\n<p>鄭佩佩於2019年被診斷出患有「非典型柏金遜症」，又稱柏金遜綜合症（Atypical Parkinsonism），即醫學上極為罕見、且目前尚無藥物可根治的「皮質基底核退化症」。面對病魔，鄭佩佩選擇低調抗病，並決定在離世後捐出大腦供學術研究。當時家屬發布的聲明中亦提到，鄭佩佩生前特別叮囑後事一切從簡、不收奠儀，並懇盼親友將款項轉捐予美國腦部支持網絡（BSN），為推動醫學進步貢獻一分力量。</p>\n<p>相關閲讀：已故武俠女星鄭佩佩80歲生忌 女兒原子鏸撰長文悼念亡母：每天都會想起妳</p>\n<img alt=\"有指鄭佩佩2019年罹患神經退化性疾病、非典型柏金遜綜合症，非官方名稱為皮質基底核退化症（CBD），屬於罕見疾病，症狀與柏金遜症相似。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7ebeed706f5fb9bd062164f960ac298f/2024-07/Marsha_39_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"一代武打女星鄭佩佩2024年離世，享年78歲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/05c72a292b685240c0d96a169407998e/2026-09/Marsha_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"家屬近日向傳媒證實已遵循鄭佩佩生前的遺願，將其大腦捐贈給美國加州的腦部研究機構。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/295577e8fbbc98557d1b99e10c1e11fb/2026-09/Marsha_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄭佩佩為罕見退化性疾病的病理研究，貢獻一份心力。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8b481678ce92cb76552491c9b2f91625/2025-01/VS--MarshaYuanmashashaInstagram-0_55_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄭佩佩曾八次懷孕卻四度流產，最終誕下3女1子。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/72cacbc18b230eb59482d48a024c21f7/2024-07/VS--MarshaYuanmashashaInstagramphotosandvideos-0_30_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄭佩佩育有三女一子。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/375497a78512eb78b387d697e1c31bc1/2024-07/VS--MarshaYuanmashashaInstagramphotosandvideos-0_05_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"原子鏸姊妹與媽媽鄭佩佩的舊照多度曝光。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1267b2fd8d8a10d401ffd8d80a66d271/2026-03/Marsha_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"思想傳統的鄭佩佩曾在接受訪問時透靈，要為三代單傳的原家生個兒子。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a3f745f1af8723be794ca1f64d9b39a7/2024-07/jjCnd7YYuyx_oyNdHzh-ayg_lv_5ChvF6c6YMunOmDI.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄭佩佩坦言因為同輩方盈、胡燕妮、江青等人都早早結婚生子，自己也受到影響，視生育當為婚姻的功課。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/748972e84ca5c8eca2524584f92d2d35/2024-07/wZllhA6Vd1NLTiGbAvWFqhyMFTboKwPy7wJ8Ru8CfEY.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"最終鄭佩佩曾八次懷孕，四次流產。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/86c6d4242b457d6577ad67d9172f9b74/2024-07/Yq6BjOKObDHTj2w_V-5E8WgNDLfEK-dTiGQCbohkAm4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄭佩佩離婚後復出，與周星馳合作演出《唐伯虎點秋香》大獲好評。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/897485bb70b3eb6c1d50b0bdcbe2884c/2023-03/CHENGPUI6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄭佩佩被封為一代俠女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1ea7db576e15321bb792717ecc00acbb/2023-03/CHENGPUI8.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄭佩佩早年曾與周星馳合作演出《唐伯虎點秋香》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/897485bb70b3eb6c1d50b0bdcbe2884c/2023-03/CHENGPUI6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄭佩佩與原文通離婚多年，但允許子女與父親保持聯繫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d6e0dd69b325435b26dd6ce387f95f36/2024-07/w1200_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄭佩佩在生時見證到子女結婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/68a3505c09b4a23c8fddbd078b6cf269/2024-07/VS--MarshaYuanmashashaInstagramphotosandvideos-0_17_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄭佩佩見證子女結婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ac0b74566d7016479cc1f01545b9e1a5/2024-07/VS--MarshaYuanmashashaInstagramphotosandvideos-0_21_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"原子鏸婚後定居美國。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/187f52f6d36359af2b00ae0504aa78a2/2023-03/unknown_288681650_590503389065096_5167430707679233313_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"原子鏸婚後定居美國。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b46ed9842988fc1f0dbfdcc0414fe0ee/2023-03/unknown_298860752_177265708110163_5257327771107982992_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"原子鏸婚後與丈夫育有一子。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/89b6af106120f7535a9623b0899a45fa/2023-03/unknown_313813642_122356300637051_3428848557850653154_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"原子鏸婚後定居美國。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ee1f3f3a4aca9a8fc723edb68843ea4b/2023-03/unknown_332546813_919384919082744_8828632763966024929_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"原子鏸與老公及兒子搬到摩洛哥。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/75b493f9870bffe0458dce08fe70590a/2023-03/unknown_333472444_653326129885610_5515507232918717072_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"原子鏸展開新生活。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a85ced6fc4cbc41ec7441b30965f3efd/2023-03/unknown_337312325_927808011601612_2952481047471845398_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄭佩佩之前公開的照片，頸部對下貼住紗布，一度嚇親網民。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2249b5f618f97d9ec28e05f74a39d35f/2023-01/Marsha%20%2834%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"原子鏸的爸爸都美國探望孫仔。​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/85e8e594cfdc36b3b43a9439d34fbcf3/2023-03/CHENGPUI9.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄭佩佩享受湊孫樂。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ff53d80f4bd0063f14a38deddcc91bff/2023-01/Marsha%20%2836%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄭佩佩早年傳出患病消息。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f9359604192508cfc04b133695805a70/2023-01/Marsha%20%2819%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"原子鏸貼出童年相，祝母親鄭佩佩生日快樂。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c83fd56b384d3055372c6697abb24c55/2023-01/Marsha%20%2848%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"兩母女好溫馨。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ac0f60021b3b0cd5b0fbaa5c5ffa974d/2023-01/Marsha%20%2849%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄭佩佩四仔女之中，二女原和珍與她最似樣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9d70849a91cb2aa0073e8a3eb5a9b7ec/2023-03/CHENGPUI11.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"原和珍曾分享與鄭佩佩的合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/614a2e4bd2f0f4d42a7b6e8b463dc2bb/2023-03/unknown_168907439_154405359907569_4056966137571590592_n.jpg\"/>\n<h2>鄭佩佩曾交代後事不買墓地</h2>\n<p>有指鄭佩佩早在確診罕見疾病前，已與香港大學簽署大體捐贈協議。鄭佩佩過去接受訪問時，曾多次以輕鬆幽默的態度談及身後事，豁達笑稱即使其他器官壞死，至少還能捐出眼角膜，並交代後事不買墓地，待醫學研究結束後將骨灰撒在校園草地上。</p>\n<p>相關閲讀：鄭佩佩離世逾年女兒原子鏸仍悲痛欲絕 突舉家橫跨地球離開傷心地 曾多次發文憶亡母：夢到你</p>\n<h2>鄭佩佩回饋社會</h2>\n<p>回顧鄭佩佩長達60年的演藝生涯，她憑電影《大醉俠》奠定一代俠女地位；其後在《唐伯虎點秋香》中飾演神經質又武功高強的「華夫人」，令人印象深刻；及後更憑《臥虎藏龍》「碧眼狐狸」一角奪得香港電影金像獎最佳女配角。2024年，她於第61屆金馬獎獲追授「終身成就獎」，成就備受肯定。</p>\n<p>相關閲讀：前港姐原子鏸與二家姐罕合體慶祝生日 原和珍神還原媽媽鄭佩佩年輕美貌氣質</p>\n<img alt=\"原子鏸曾在IG分享與二姊原和珍的合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/be26128db49e1e03372f646c129b9dba/2026-03/Marsha_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"原子鏸感謝二姊原和珍探望。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/76a03887d5e575e0f3237aace3cec91d/2026-03/Marsha_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"原子鏸與二姊原和珍四圍去。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dfb41fd052e5c1ea41becd5ecd4dbcb5/2026-03/Marsha_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"原子鏸的二姊原和珍好似媽媽鄭佩佩。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0795a331c4872d5bdba16839d926d5ae/2026-03/Marsha_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"原子鏸與二姊原和珍笑容一致。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6bcf1278ddf4e8f1d9731d73f54225fa/2026-03/Marsha_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"原和珍跟鄭佩佩非常似樣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/50a8554f7c68cd1be2876b4c4efa2c74/2023-03/unknown_122879365_392263981947978_1453970592817327992_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"原子鏸早前曾分享與家姐原和珍的合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0c4c65cc03dbc58959431777605178f9/2023-03/unknown_337303063_752870473109735_5604956365233207508_n%20%285%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"原和珍不時分享生活照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c901c47ca6d2ab59f53e8687dbf4a053/2023-03/unknown_120051970_200211821467726_4114146705184120568_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"原和珍在美國生活。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4363cfecd9ecf470291f715d11ebf153/2023-03/unknown_164773903_1426499004355973_3834977587601068508_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"原和珍生活照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bd4e3f26734f2d058b5b57659dd34386/2023-03/unknown_284551713_1021943788758942_4180097307127174559_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"原子鏸一臉驚喜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/049493f6782d402bba11540ca4b5fd70/2026-03/Marsha_9_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"原子鏸與二姊原和珍收到蛋糕。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/57d36e4781ea562825a76ea7420799c8/2026-03/Marsha_10_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"原子鏸與二姊原和珍一齊慶祝生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1a92d5987fcb1737040c962ea7b69bc9/2026-03/Marsha_11_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"原子鏸指長大後，與二姊原和珍一齊慶祝好難得。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bd2c6c1902adbb084ea45c30f2ebb2d1/2026-03/Marsha_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"原子鏸與原和珍抱住小朋友吹蠟燭。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/db542fc68358f19afa31163862ca7912/2026-03/Marsha_13_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"原子鏸的囝囝吹蠟燭。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6ff9abcfe97d0fa2981c104d954b8734/2026-03/Marsha_14_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"小朋友好落力。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/94737a37267324ec0f579aa4dd64e44d/2026-03/Marsha_15_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"小朋友代吹蠟燭。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/88abeb0cc289944c934cbdee511a5893/2026-03/Marsha_16_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"原子鏸再畀機會囝囝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/848c0f72366461096ae028724007d472/2026-03/Marsha_17_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"小朋友用盡九牛二虎之一力。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f18ecad0de7c032921339794cf19057f/2026-03/Marsha_18_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"原和珍見到小朋友好活潑，笑得好開心。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ab8aac61e5cd8da8d68ffc487fa5a12a/2026-03/Marsha_19_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"原子鏸感謝胞姊原和珍特意抽空探望。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1a3c3a2a76cf9827484939abfedf5d4c/2026-03/Marsha_20_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"原子鏸透露胞姊原和珍陪伴約一個月。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d6e1a40dcd3af7ea38cae4b082f77a8d/2026-03/Marsha_21_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"原子鏸兩姊妹難得聚會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6e2fcc754186c2726efcd9df58be2fc2/2026-03/Marsha_23_.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-09T06:39:52.680241+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":752,"images":54,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}